����洛姆族是最早走出母星的群体。他们没有特别突出的能力，却拥有最稳定的适应性。在先驱者舰队中，大多数训练生都来自洛姆族。�The Loom were the first group to leave their home planet. They possess no particularly outstanding abilities, but they have the most stable adaptability. Within the Pioneer Fleet, most trainees come from the Loom.
�¸�霜鬃族诞生于母星的极寒地带。他们进化出了特殊的能量储存组织，能够在严寒中维持生命机能。在先驱者舰队中，霜鬃族经常被派往最危险的任务。�The Frosmane were born in the frigid regions of the home planet. They evolved specialized energy-storage organs that allow them to maintain bodily functions in extreme cold. Within the Pioneer Fleet, the Frosmane are often assigned to the most dangerous missions.

�ø�塔塔族诞生于母星最贫瘠的草原。因为长期在获取食物困难的环境中生活，他们格外擅长抵抗饥饿。当其他族群停下寻找食物时，塔塔族仍然可以继续前行。�The Tavil originated from the most barren grasslands of the home planet. Having lived in environments where food was scarce, they are exceptionally resistant to hunger. While other groups must stop to search for food, the Tavil can continue moving forward.

�ĸ�德岚族来自母星最干旱的裂谷带。他们的代谢系统可以极度节约水分，依赖植物提供的水源生存。在水源短缺的环境中，他们的天赋尤其重要。�The Dren come from the driest rift valleys of the home planet. Their metabolic systems can conserve water to an extreme degree, relying on plants as their primary water source. In environments where water is scarce, their abilities become vital.

�Ÿ�维洛族来自母星的高原地带。为了寻找远处的水源与迁徙的兽群，维洛族进化出了过人的运动能力。在先驱者时代，他们是最早的远域侦察者。�The Velra originate from the highlands of the home planet. In order to locate distant water sources and migrating herds, they evolved extraordinary physical mobility. During the Pioneer era, they were the earliest long-range scouts.
�Ƹ�莫鲁族是母星的游牧种族。他们常年面临着资源短缺的问题，为了生存，他们一切的消耗都比其他种族更缓慢。他们擅长在恶劣的环境下生存，进行长期探索。�The Morru are a nomadic species of the home planet. They have long faced resource scarcity, and as a result, all their consumption processes are slower than those of other species. They excel at surviving in harsh environments and conducting long-term exploration.

�Ǹ�在最古老的传说中，母星的大裂谷发生过一次异常的星辉降临。那一天，天空像燃烧一样明亮。少数个体在那次光芒中发生了异变，他们观察力过人，能够发现更多的物资。�In the oldest legends, an anomalous starlight once descended upon the great rift of the home planet. On that day, the sky burned with blinding brightness. A small number of individuals underwent mutations in that light—gaining extraordinary perception and the ability to discover more resources.